  "narrationScript": "Socho 2019 mein AI ek simple image bhi sahi se identify nahi kar sakta tha. Aur 2024 mein? AI ne MMLU pe 90% score kiya — almost insaan ke barabar. Yeh benchmark hai jisme medical, law, aur science ke questions hain. ImageNet pe AI ki accuracy 91.1% ho gayi. Sirf 2023 mein 149 naaye frontier models launch hue. US mein AI investment $67.2 billion pahunch gayi. HumanEval pe Claude 3 ne 84.9% score kiya — matlab AI ab code bhi likh sakti hai. Lekin yeh race abhi khatam nahi hui. Benchmarks saturate ho rahe hain — matlab hume aur mushkil tests chahiye. AI advancing hai, faster than anyone predicted.",
